{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4VcN8YutYSPZTeASw8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, silent.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully in its center, waiting.*\n\n*You hold up a key. Just... a key. No teeth cut for this lock. No ward, no bit, no bow that matches.*\n\n*The keyhole regards your offering the way a mouth regards a word in the wrong language.*\n\n*Nothing turns. Nothing yields.*\n\n*The door remains.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}